flowchart Order Fulfilment
subtitle How an order moves from checkout to the customer's door

(Checkout) -> [Reserve stock] -> <In stock?>
  -yes-> [Pick and pack] -> [Ship] -> (Delivered)
  -no-> [Backorder] -> [Reserve stock]

footnote Backorders retry every six hours.
source Warehouse operations handbook, 2025
byline Chart: Diagrammo
